#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:3
#: 9ceac07800da43e9a3f87dd48a31fbbd
msgid "插隙与表面吸附（Interstitial and Surface Adsorption）"
msgstr "Interstitial and Surface Adsorption"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:5
#: 44bba6f423854dd5ac73b2ed0059d0f1
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:7
#: 45cfeea12eff4a7aa8e1274763b246e1
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:9
#: 7d2563427dca44f3996257f898ee270a
msgid "为每个输入结构生成两类未弛豫候选："
msgstr "Generate two types of unrelaxed candidates for each input structure:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:11
#: 7423f1e5d9014abab467eac34d023c7b
msgid "**体相随机插隙**：在晶胞内部按分数坐标均匀随机取点并插入原子。"
msgstr "**Random bulk interstitials**: sample points uniformly in fractional coordinates inside the cell and insert atoms."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:12
#: c06772671909465685f9b2b50bf391da
msgid ""
"**上表面随机吸附**：在指定晶格方向的上表面随机取横向位置，并放到原始宿主最高"
"原子平面上方的固定高度。"
msgstr "**Random upper-surface adsorption**: sample lateral positions on the upper surface along the selected lattice direction and place atoms at a fixed height above the highest plane of the original host atoms."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:14
#: 5c77640cd0704cd4ac7e5e89757a9bab
msgid ""
"两种模式都用最小原子间距排除明显碰撞。该距离同时检查候选点到宿主原子和此前已"
"插入原子的距离。"
msgstr "Both modes reject obvious collisions with a minimum interatomic distance. The distance is checked against host atoms and atoms inserted earlier in the same output."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:16
#: 8978afee3ef44558ac93ea9c617ce806
msgid ""
"这张卡**不识别晶体学间隙位或化学吸附位**：不会自动寻找四面体、八面体、顶位、"
"桥位或空位，也不会弛豫坐标。它适合生成连续随机候选，再交给 DFT、几何优化、能"
"量筛选或 `FPS Filter`；需要确定的物理路径时，应使用专门的位点或路径构造工具。"
msgstr "This card **does not identify crystallographic interstitial or chemisorption sites**: it does not automatically find tetrahedral, octahedral, top, bridge, or vacancy sites, and it does not relax coordinates. Use it to generate continuous random candidates for DFT, geometry optimization, energy screening, or `FPS Filter`; use a dedicated site or path-construction tool when a prescribed physical path is required."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:18
#: 0685fe6b74354d9e845553ad531df9c2
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:20
#: 8f39ba12c88a48cd9a7e6df8e3676c3a
msgid "体相随机插隙"
msgstr "Random bulk interstitials"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:22
#: 0184cfedc4554e779fca76c1fa174a5f
msgid ""
"每次在 `[0,1)^3` 中抽取一个分数坐标并映射到晶胞。候选点满足 `最小原子间距`"
"（`min_distance`）后才会插入。若一个输出需要多个原子，后插入的原子也会避开先"
"插入的原子。"
msgstr "For each attempt, draw a fractional coordinate in `[0,1)^3` and map it into the cell. Insert the candidate only when it satisfies `Minimum interatomic distance` (`min_distance`). If an output needs multiple atoms, later insertions also avoid atoms inserted earlier."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:24
#: faecadc2a6514423b5d3cd973c80d97d
msgid "上表面随机吸附"
msgstr "Random upper-surface adsorption"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:26
#: e12fd6a2ce024e66bc49d795e54adcdd
msgid ""
"`真空／表面法向方向`（`axis`）指定 slab 真空所在的晶格方向 `a`、`b` 或 `c`。"
"程序以原始宿主原子的最大分数坐标确定上表面，在该平面内随机取点，再沿真实表面"
"法向移动 `高于最高原子平面的距离`（`offset`）。"
msgstr "`Vacuum/surface-normal direction` (`axis`) selects the lattice direction `a`, `b`, or `c` containing the slab vacuum. The program locates the upper surface from the maximum fractional coordinate of the original host atoms, samples a point in that plane, and moves it along the true surface normal by `Distance above the highest atomic plane` (`offset`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:28
#: 401a60cf7b4d4edeaf2b6a62c1cc8afd
msgid ""
"对于倾斜晶胞，法向由对应的倒易方向计算，而不是直接沿晶格矢量移动。多个吸附原"
"子始终以同一个原始宿主平面为参考，不会逐个向上堆叠。当前只生成上表面候选。"
msgstr "For a tilted cell, the normal is computed from the corresponding reciprocal direction rather than by moving directly along a lattice vector. Multiple adsorbates always use the same original host plane as the reference; they are not stacked upward one by one. Only upper-surface candidates are generated."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:30
#: 0ef269e61ceb41b498f543d1d9a65b41
msgid "完整输出约束"
msgstr "Complete-output constraints"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:32
#: c13d66d1a14642a193615e8fdc304f53
msgid ""
"每个输出必须插满 `每个输出插入原子数`（`insert_count`）个原子。任何一个原子"
"在 `每个原子的放置尝试次数`（`max_attempts`）次尝试后仍无法放置时，卡片会明确"
"报错，不返回未修改或只完成一部分的伪成功结构。"
msgstr "Every output must contain exactly `Atoms inserted per output` (`insert_count`) atoms. If any atom cannot be placed after `Placement attempts per atom` (`max_attempts`) attempts, the card fails explicitly instead of returning an unchanged or partially completed pseudo-success."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:34
#: dc7fdf228fb349198fa5975aa7cec8d8
msgid "两种模式都要求每个候选点 $\\mathbf r$ 满足"
msgstr "Both modes require every candidate point $\\mathbf r$ to satisfy"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:36
#: 2f5bcfa0a0084ef29406d8e4e02d6663
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\min_j d_{\\mathrm{MIC}}(\\mathbf r,\\mathbf r_j)\\ge d_{\\min},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:40
#: be0b6aeca1164858b75815c753bde5c9
msgid ""
"其中 $d_{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ 是按输入周期边界计算的最小镜像距离，$d_{\\min}$ 的单"
"位为 Å； $\\mathbf r_j$ 同时包含宿主原子和本次已插入原子。多元素输入按归一化"
"权重抽取插入元素。"
msgstr "Here $d_{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ is the minimum-image distance under the input periodic boundaries, and $d_{\\min}$ is in Å; $\\mathbf r_j$ includes both host atoms and atoms inserted in the current output. For multielement inputs, inserted elements are sampled from normalized weights."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:43
#: b3068b2364e54d1e86f612da90a867c4
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:45
#: c5be381f03a847fdb0e492f95eec4e20
msgid "场景：训练集缺少表面吸附初始构型"
msgstr "Scenario: the training set lacks initial surface-adsorption configurations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:47
#: 82bb03aa74464b1aa07c3e5c096de1ab
msgid ""
"模型在洁净表面和少量弛豫吸附构型上表现正常，但对随机初始吸附位置的能量和力误"
"差很大。这说明训练集只覆盖了稳定极小值，缺少优化路径起点和高能横向位置。"
msgstr "The model performs normally on a clean surface and a few relaxed adsorbate configurations, but its energy and force errors are large for random initial adsorption positions. This indicates that the training set covers only stable minima and lacks optimization-path starting points and high-energy lateral positions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:49
#: 004ddd1feac0422186b763d4a9dc0f06
msgid "**输入：** 带真空层的 slab，真空沿晶格 `c`。"
msgstr "**Input:** a slab with a vacuum layer along lattice direction `c`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:51
#: 2c0422dda8cb4c83861500f33eb8c1e5
msgid "**目标：** 在上表面放置一个 O 原子，生成 50 个横向位置不同的候选。"
msgstr "**Goal:** place one O atom on the upper surface and generate 50 candidates with different lateral positions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:53
#: 6ebba517195a483d9cf7c42c83d774f7
msgid "**参数：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:55
#: 3b31b03c615c4352abef94257327365b
msgid "`插入模式`（`mode`）：`Random upper-surface adsorption`"
msgstr "`Insertion mode` (`mode`): `Random upper-surface adsorption`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:56
#: 55fdf7dcee85468388fb1a9e7974047c
msgid "`插入元素与权重`（`species`）：`O`"
msgstr "`Inserted elements and weights` (`species`): `O`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:57
#: 5507a5800a6b4304a9ba38a16eb72fce
msgid "`每个输出插入原子数`（`insert_count`）：`1`"
msgstr "`Atoms inserted per output` (`insert_count`): `1`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:58
#: 7fc072e3eb044691a34e3c9bfed3974d
msgid "`每个输入的输出数`（`structure_count`）：`50`"
msgstr "`Outputs per input` (`structure_count`): `50`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:59
#: bd6d7aef179b49e3bf1d92d92fa9660a
msgid "`最小原子间距`（`min_distance`）：`1.4 Å`"
msgstr "`Minimum interatomic distance` (`min_distance`): `1.4 Å`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:60
#: 7ae1a927eeea4de48a9f4d97a094b354
msgid "`真空／表面法向方向`（`axis`）：`Lattice c direction`"
msgstr "`Vacuum/surface-normal direction` (`axis`): `Lattice c direction`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:61
#: 2402538408aa45138ab48e82ef753a42
msgid "`高于最高原子平面的距离`（`offset`）：`1.8 Å`"
msgstr "`Distance above the highest atomic plane` (`offset`): `1.8 Å`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:62
#: b04b4988f4ab42a29d93dc28364246ce
msgid "`使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）：开启，便于比较后续筛选方案"
msgstr "`Use random seed` (`use_seed`): enabled to make later screening schemes comparable"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:64
#: ec53983fd83a4633beb5e17e14b6841b
msgid "**验证：**"
msgstr "**Validation:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:66
#: b9d746365e9543d4b1ab616d596f5a9b
msgid "每个输出应比输入多一个 O，并带 `Ins(ad,n=1)` 标签。"
msgstr "Each output should contain one more O atom than the input and carry the `Ins(ad,n=1)` label."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:67
#: 13ea41a6cc08484c8d8b03987eec2132
msgid "插入原子到所有宿主原子的最近距离应不小于 `1.4 Å`。"
msgstr "The nearest distance from the inserted atom to every host atom should be at least `1.4 Å`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:68
#: 0a17306061e8435e985ca3804ba138f7
msgid "50 个 O 应处于相同法向高度，但横向位置不同。"
msgstr "The 50 O atoms should have the same normal height but different lateral positions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:69
#: 1eb4fe8849b24a29998db01f8cf952b1
msgid "几何优化或 DFT 标注后，再检查模型对吸附初始构型的能量和力误差是否下降。"
msgstr "After geometry optimization or DFT labeling, check whether the model's energy and force errors on initial adsorption configurations decrease."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:71
#: 6d8f62b236504da0b4a597da55289252
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:73
#: 35bb396423cf423a967604da7525055d
msgid "模式与元素"
msgstr "Modes and elements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:75
#: f11b2bb7950549f7b1d1ae0feb937d49
msgid "插入模式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:77
#: 36d235d15e874fa29c9346eedabd22d6
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:79
#: a431726980834693bb15b4a400ebc556
msgid "`0`：体相随机插隙，在整个晶胞内连续随机取点。"
msgstr "`0`: random bulk interstitials, with continuous random sampling throughout the cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:80
#: 3b41ce7948924f68a33030b6e7010225
msgid "`1`：上表面随机吸附，在指定上表面随机取横向位置。"
msgstr "`1`: random upper-surface adsorption, with random lateral positions on the selected upper surface."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:82
#: ddbda4fdc3c54ee7a69f5eeb94c94205
msgid "插入元素与权重（species）"
msgstr "species"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:84
#: d6c3ace7429641f39631ca9a4b9ab125
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空，运行时必填。可填写单一元素 `Li`，或使用相对权重 `Li:7, Na:3`。"
"多个插入原子会分别独立抽样，因此权重表示概率，不保证单个输出达到精确组成。"
msgstr "`str`, default empty and required at run time. Enter a single element such as `Li`, or relative weights such as `Li:7, Na:3`. Multiple inserted atoms are sampled independently, so weights represent probabilities and do not guarantee an exact composition in each output."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:86
#: 69c9dbda59e44605aef3ffdf134cb114
msgid "元素符号必须有效，权重必须为有限正数。重复元素的权重会合并。"
msgstr "Element symbols must be valid and weights must be finite positive numbers. Weights for duplicate elements are merged."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:88
#: 38751e26d6f4440e9a7fbdf0c3197cc4
msgid "输出数量"
msgstr "Output counts"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:90
#: f1a981c156ad4374b5e49562fd3e2c06
msgid "每个输出插入原子数（insert_count）"
msgstr "insert_count"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:92
#: 03e28f1ec2b8407b854a412d04647c5b
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。每个成功输出必须插入的原子数，界面范围为 1–20。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`. Number of atoms that every successful output must insert; the UI range is 1–20."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:94
#: f2e76256b54742cd906faf41a9c073ee
msgid "每个输入的输出数（structure_count）"
msgstr "structure_count"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:96
#: 061634c3517a45459c03a188a9112cbe
msgid "`int`，默认 `10`。每个输入结构生成的完整输出数，界面范围为 1–1000。"
msgstr "`int`, default `10`. Number of complete outputs generated per input structure; the UI range is 1–1000."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:98
#: 5073db3f5653410f819dd35b0640d427
msgid "几何与尝试预算"
msgstr "Geometry and attempt budget"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:100
#: b9132ada26754f5a9b658409df037461
msgid "最小原子间距（min_distance）"
msgstr "min_distance"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:102
#: 6e99092f481d47b89b7f97a0f4123d20
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `1.4 Å`。候选点到宿主原子和已插入原子的最小允许距离。必须为有限"
"正数。"
msgstr "`float`, default `1.4 Å`. Minimum allowed distance from a candidate point to host atoms and already inserted atoms. It must be finite and positive."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:104
#: 2f8260ed40534f32a800449bcb877311
msgid ""
"该值只排除明显近距离碰撞，不代表化学合理的键长。不同元素体系应按原子尺寸和预"
"期局域环境调整。"
msgstr "This value only excludes obvious close collisions; it is not a chemically reasonable bond length. Adjust it for the atomic sizes and expected local environments of the elements involved."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:106
#: a08aeaadafdd4077a6e5f37bd9e49cf3
msgid "每个原子的放置尝试次数（max_attempts）"
msgstr "max_attempts"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:108
#: 72f25a976a9746d492044b5e44737ed8
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `200`。每个待插入原子的最大随机尝试次数。达到上限仍找不到满足距离"
"的位置时，整个操作报错。"
msgstr "`int`, default `200`. Maximum random attempts for each atom to be inserted. If no position satisfying the distance constraint is found by the limit, the whole operation fails."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:110
#: f3043b42fa1d484e9f0daa91432b99ac
msgid ""
"连续触发上限通常说明晶胞过密、插入数过多或 `最小原子间距`（`min_distance`）过"
"大；单纯继续提高尝试次数未必有效。"
msgstr "Repeatedly reaching the limit usually indicates an overcrowded cell, too many insertions, or an overly large `Minimum interatomic distance` (`min_distance`); simply increasing the attempt count may not help."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:112
#: 559b6fb0435e4e85b1ca98b4e247c599
msgid "表面吸附"
msgstr "Surface adsorption"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:114
#: e019e7789716436a80da607a18ef3ae6
msgid "真空／表面法向方向（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:116
#: c229558938a749eda4ca5051679b5c5d
msgid "`int`，默认 `2`，仅在吸附模式生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default `2`, used only in adsorption mode."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:118
#: e29a673ba6d44920af1fb34df67e82a1
msgid "`0`：真空沿晶格 `a`"
msgstr "`0`: vacuum along lattice direction `a`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:119
#: 24f774f4dbcc4301a73f4f763016ae3e
msgid "`1`：真空沿晶格 `b`"
msgstr "`1`: vacuum along lattice direction `b`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:120
#: 99b62309f13241a7bb00f2f1d5de8011
msgid "`2`：真空沿晶格 `c`"
msgstr "`2`: vacuum along lattice direction `c`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:122
#: d31e69a7dbff486b878e84ab39033ca0
msgid ""
"这里选择的是晶格方向，不等同于笛卡尔 `x`、`y`、`z`。程序会据此计算真实表面法"
"向。"
msgstr "This selects a lattice direction, not a Cartesian `x`, `y`, or `z` axis. The program uses it to compute the true surface normal."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:124
#: 4b787835011a451cb929618afb412d25
msgid "高于最高原子平面的距离（offset）"
msgstr "offset"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:126
#: 48cfc118271e42d6a069b50500fbbdc1
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `1.5 Å`，仅在吸附模式生效。表示候选原子到原始宿主最高原子平面的"
"法向距离，必须为有限正数。"
msgstr "`float`, default `1.5 Å`, used only in adsorption mode. This is the normal distance from a candidate atom to the highest atomic plane of the original host and must be finite and positive."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:128
#: f35ee69ede0142c28ca09572af7ef66e
msgid "该参数不会自动扩大晶胞。应先确保 slab 有足够真空容纳吸附原子。"
msgstr "This parameter does not enlarge the cell automatically. Ensure that the slab has enough vacuum to contain the adsorbates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:130
#: 3c7e59ac56364c298e2ca5eb9a69cb48
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:132
#: 7944a250db3f4910938b0e5ed6454ea1
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:134
#: 04436fd21ee8488d907b348120515eec
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。启用后可复现同一输入结构的元素选择和几何位置。"
msgstr "`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, element choices and geometric positions are reproducible for the same input structure."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:136
#: 9f3013f1252a40b0a92d500f03ec0c9f
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:138
#: e1b7324e9e384590ab8214ff1f636051
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `0`，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。种子会与结构内容共同派生，因此"
"几何不同的输入帧不会机械地获得相同分数坐标。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`, used only when `use_seed=true`. The seed is derived together with the structure content, so geometrically different input frames do not mechanically receive the same fractional coordinates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:140
#: ccdb94aa31fa4c8585c14bcead3751df
msgid "推荐配置"
msgstr "Recommended configurations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:142
#: 03e26d65558d43ebb71925a62a33f34e
msgid "体相单原子插隙"
msgstr "Single-atom bulk interstitials"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:144
#: b9474249c6204b06816220d3664e01f9
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"InsertDefectCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"mode\": 0,\n"
"    \"species\": \"Li\",\n"
"    \"insert_count\": 1,\n"
"    \"structure_count\": 50,\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 1.4,\n"
"    \"max_attempts\": 200,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42,\n"
"    \"axis\": 2,\n"
"    \"offset\": 1.5\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:163
#: f6e56e075999439aa7d8fc5a56c5c28b
msgid "上表面混合吸附候选"
msgstr "Mixed upper-surface adsorption candidates"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:165
#: 352ba25bbd914e7e97dc9f6d35baa2c0
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"InsertDefectCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"mode\": 1,\n"
"    \"species\": \"O:3, H:1\",\n"
"    \"insert_count\": 2,\n"
"    \"structure_count\": 50,\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 1.2,\n"
"    \"max_attempts\": 300,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42,\n"
"    \"axis\": 2,\n"
"    \"offset\": 1.8\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:184
#: ba9102a1e934492c9eca3d025e277753
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:186
#: acd10af470b14606ab773e00692c1be8
msgid ""
"`Random Slab` → `Insert Defect`：先生成带真空层的表面，再放置上表面吸附候选。"
msgstr "`Random Slab` → `Insert Defect`: generate a surface with a vacuum layer first, then place upper-surface adsorption candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:187
#: 278ec3a0eee54f02bdfda290fb4a066a
msgid "`Insert Defect` → 几何优化或 DFT：本卡输出是未弛豫随机候选。"
msgstr "`Insert Defect` → geometry optimization or DFT: this card produces unrelaxed random candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:188
#: 8504b7de4630402f9ddb94e1edd0261f
msgid ""
"`Insert Defect` → `FPS Filter`：大量候选经过描述符筛选后再进入昂贵计算。"
msgstr "`Insert Defect` → `FPS Filter`: screen a large candidate pool by descriptors before expensive calculations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:190
#: a4b7a74c5c984579b731febca9aa09f3
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:192
#: f5f0c5cb8d7e4e3393a0d93dd7ebac45
msgid "**为什么没有四面体或八面体位点选项？**"
msgstr "**Why are there no tetrahedral or octahedral site options?**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:194
#: 8d0f2c004c384d71b1f4f603a1434ef8
msgid ""
"当前算法不做晶体学位点识别，只在连续空间随机采样。需要确定间隙位时，应使用专"
"门的位点生成方法。"
msgstr "The current algorithm does not identify crystallographic sites; it samples randomly in continuous space. Use a dedicated site-generation method when a specific interstitial site is required."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:196
#: 02a6758c07e7483eb5f9577b2744a792
msgid "**为什么运行直接报“无法放置”？**"
msgstr "**Why does the run report “unable to place atom”?**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:198
#: 69231371e26f43148db8a3990d547ad9
msgid ""
"卡片不会返回插入数不足的结构。先检查 `最小原子间距`（`min_distance`）、插入原"
"子数和晶胞可用空间，再决定是否增加尝试次数。"
msgstr "The card does not return structures with too few insertions. Check `Minimum interatomic distance` (`min_distance`), the insertion count, and available cell space before increasing the attempt count."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:200
#: 53708226b4b143028db28113d521c170
msgid "**为什么吸附原子可能位于晶胞范围外？**"
msgstr "**Why can an adsorbate lie outside the cell bounds?**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:202
#: 5327454f3dff4483a35eb171e9275921
msgid ""
"卡片保持原晶胞和宿主坐标不变，也不会静默包裹吸附原子。请先在表面法向留出足够"
"真空，或在后续计算前明确扩展晶胞。"
msgstr "The card keeps the original cell and host coordinates unchanged and does not silently wrap adsorbates. Leave enough vacuum along the surface normal, or explicitly enlarge the cell before subsequent calculations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:204
#: 449dd557776c4b0da5d8b9e7efdcbfae
msgid "**如何生成下表面吸附？**"
msgstr "**How can I generate lower-surface adsorption?**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:206
#: 24f48a779ab044bb85571d3970331397
msgid ""
"当前只生成所选晶格方向的上表面。可先翻转 slab，或使用明确支持上下表面的专门工"
"具。"
msgstr "Only the upper surface along the selected lattice direction is generated. Flip the slab first, or use a dedicated tool that explicitly supports both surfaces."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:208
#: 751a8b89c0c74068a28c551b25e55bd4
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:210
#: 716b7fce5f3c4c97a8705ded001e8fa9
msgid "体相插隙：`Ins(int,n={插入数})`"
msgstr "Bulk interstitial: `Ins(int,n={count})`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:211
#: 64bae7879f4540f9ad8e39413349f057
msgid "上表面吸附：`Ins(ad,n={插入数})`"
msgstr "Upper-surface adsorption: `Ins(ad,n={count})`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:213
#: 07af5a2cb6dc43009a8ee225cd893c82
msgid "兼容性"
msgstr "Compatibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:215
#: 6b75c69f86314b8eab0c00863dc47bf9
msgid ""
"内部 `card_name`、类名和参数键保持不变。旧版顶层参数和当前 `params` 对象都可"
"以读取；显示名称和失败语义已收紧。"
msgstr "The internal `card_name`, class name, and parameter keys remain unchanged. Both legacy top-level parameters and the current `params` object can be read; display names and failure semantics are now stricter."

#~ msgid "插隙/吸附缺陷（Insert Defect）"
#~ msgstr "Interstitial and Adsorbate Defects (Insert Defect)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "在体相或表面结构中随机插入额外原子。支持 Interstitial（体相间隙位插入）和 "
#~ "Adsorption（表面吸附位放置）两种模式，用最小距离约束避免原子碰撞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Randomly add atoms to bulk or surface structures. Interstitial mode "
#~ "places atoms at candidate sites inside a bulk cell, while Adsorption mode "
#~ "places them above a surface. A minimum-distance constraint prevents "
#~ "direct atomic overlap."

#~ msgid "场景：模型对 Li 扩散路径预测完全错误"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: the model predicts an incorrect Li diffusion pathway"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 LiCoO2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型跑 Li 扩散。模型预测的扩散势垒比 DFT 低了"
#~ "一半——中间态的能量被严重低估。检查训练集发现：所有结构里 Li 都待在八面体位"
#~ "点，从来没见过 Li 在四面体间隙位的结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You trained an NEP model for Li diffusion in LiCoO2. Its predicted "
#~ "diffusion barrier is only half the DFT value because the intermediate "
#~ "states are severely underestimated. Inspection shows that every training "
#~ "structure places Li at an octahedral site; none contains Li near a "
#~ "tetrahedral interstitial site."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 扩散路径上的过渡态对应 Li 从一个八面体位穿过四面体间隙位跃"
#~ "迁到相邻八面体位的过程。训练集里只有基态构型，模型自然会低估中间态能量。需"
#~ "要往训练集里加入 Li 在四面体间隙位附近的构型，让模型见过这些局域环境。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** Along this diffusion path, Li moves from one octahedral "
#~ "site to the next through a tetrahedral interstitial region. A training "
#~ "set that contains only ground-state occupations gives the model no "
#~ "information about those intermediate local environments. Add "
#~ "configurations with Li near tetrahedral interstitial sites so the model "
#~ "can learn their energies."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 LiCoO2 超胞"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A LiCoO2 supercell."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 在体相中插入单个 Li 原子于随机间隙位，生成 50 个候选构型"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Goal:** Generate 50 candidates by inserting one Li atom at a random "
#~ "interstitial position in the bulk cell."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 50 个插隙结构，每个含一个额外 Li 原子放置于不与宿主原子碰撞的位"
#~ "置，带 `Ins(int,n=1)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** 50 interstitial structures, each containing one additional Li "
#~ "atom at a position that does not collide with the host atoms, labeled "
#~ "`Ins(int,n=1)`."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后用 NEB 算 Li 扩散势垒，应接近 DFT 参考值"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After DFT labeling and retraining, calculate the Li diffusion barrier "
#~ "with NEB and compare it with the DFT reference."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "抽查插入原子的最近邻距离：≥ min_distance 是底线，太近（<1.0 Å）的结构应该"
#~ "不会出现"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect the nearest-neighbor distance of the inserted atom. It must be at "
#~ "least `min_distance`; structures with contacts below 1.0 Å should not "
#~ "appear."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果成功率很低（输出远少于 50 个），增大 `max_attempts` 或降低 "
#~ "`min_distance`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the success rate is low and far fewer than 50 structures are produced, "
#~ "increase `max_attempts` or reduce `min_distance`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果是表面吸附场景，切到 `Mode` = `Adsorption`，调整 `offset` 控制吸附高度"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For surface adsorption, set `Mode` to `Adsorption` and use `offset` to "
#~ "control the adsorption height."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "模型对扩散、吸附、插层位点预测不准"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The model is inaccurate for diffusion, adsorption, or intercalation sites."

#~ msgid "训练集只有完美晶格占据，缺少间隙原子环境"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The training set contains only ideal lattice occupations and lacks "
#~ "interstitial environments."

#~ msgid "研究表面催化、电池材料离子输运"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You are studying surface catalysis or ion transport in battery materials."

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "只需基态占据 → 不需要额外插入原子"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Only ground-state occupations are needed → no additional atoms are "
#~ "required."

#~ msgid "插入物种与宿主剧烈反应（如碱金属+水）→ 先确认化学可行性"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The inserted species can react violently with the host, such as an alkali "
#~ "metal with water → establish chemical feasibility first."

#~ msgid "插入模式和数量"
#~ msgstr "Insertion mode and count"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 0。`0` = Interstitial（体相插隙），在晶胞内随机采样位点放入额"
#~ "外原子；`1` = Adsorption（表面吸附），沿表面法向在表面上方放置原子。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `0`. `0` selects Interstitial mode, which samples "
#~ "positions inside the cell; `1` selects Adsorption mode, which places "
#~ "atoms above the surface along its normal."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Interstitial 模式下 `axis` 和 `offset` 不生效。Adsorption 模式需要 slab 输"
#~ "入，`axis` 决定了吸附原子沿哪条晶轴放。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`axis` and `offset` are ignored in Interstitial mode. Adsorption mode "
#~ "requires a slab input, and `axis` selects the cell direction along which "
#~ "adsorbates are placed above the surface."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空。逗号分隔的元素列表，指定要插入什么原子。支持权重写法："
#~ "`Li:0.7,Na:0.3` 表示每次随机放置时有 70% 概率插 Li，30% 概率插 Na。权重不"
#~ "写则等概率。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: empty. Comma-separated elements to insert. Weighted "
#~ "entries are supported: `Li:0.7,Na:0.3` chooses Li with 70% probability "
#~ "and Na with 30% probability for each placement. Without weights, the "
#~ "elements are sampled uniformly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 1。每个生成结构里插几个额外原子。1~3 是常见范围——单原子插隙最"
#~ "容易放进去，数量越大碰撞失败概率越高。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `1`. Number of additional atoms in each generated "
#~ "structure. A typical range is 1–3. A single interstitial is easiest to "
#~ "place; larger counts increase the chance that placement fails because of "
#~ "collisions."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 10。每输入帧生成多少个插入版本。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `10`. Number of inserted variants generated for each "
#~ "input frame."

#~ msgid "10~50 做轻量验证，50~200 常规覆盖，200 以上建议接 `FPS Filter`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use 10–50 for a lightweight check and 50–200 for routine coverage. For "
#~ "more than 200, follow this card with `FPS Filter`."

#~ msgid "几何约束"
#~ msgstr "Geometric constraints"

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 1.4。候选插入点与已有原子的最小允许距离，单位 Å。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `1.4`. Minimum allowed distance, in Å, between a "
#~ "candidate insertion point and every existing atom."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "对致密晶体，1.6~2.5 Å 比较保守安全；1.2~1.6 Å 是一个平衡点；压到 0.8~1.2 "
#~ "Å 碰撞风险明显升高，只有在你确信结构能容纳时才用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For dense crystals, 1.6–2.5 Å is conservative; 1.2–1.6 Å balances "
#~ "acceptance and separation. At 0.8–1.2 Å the collision risk rises "
#~ "substantially, so use such values only when the chemistry and available "
#~ "volume justify them."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 200。每个待插入原子的最大随机尝试次数。增大它可以提高放置成功"
#~ "率，但耗时线性增长——如果你发现 200 次几乎每次都触顶失败，说明问题不是尝试"
#~ "次数不够，而是 `min_distance` 设大了或者胞太密。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `200`. Maximum random placement attempts for each atom to "
#~ "insert. Increasing it may improve acceptance but increases cost linearly. "
#~ "If nearly every insertion exhausts all 200 attempts, the real problem is "
#~ "usually an overly large `min_distance` or an excessively dense cell."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 2。Adsorption 模式下它是表面法向。如果你的 slab 真空沿 z，默"
#~ "认 2（z 轴）就不用改；表面取向不同时一定要调，否则吸附高度方向会错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `2`. Surface-normal axis in Adsorption mode. Keep the "
#~ "default `2` when the slab vacuum lies along *z*. Change it for a "
#~ "differently oriented surface; otherwise the adsorption height will be "
#~ "applied along the wrong direction."

#~ msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
#~ "initialization."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 1.5。表面吸附时原子放在表面上方多远，单位 Å。"
