#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出为空或数量远少于预期。** `min_distance` 太严、`max_attempts` 太小，"
#~ "或者输入超胞太密找不到合适位点。先放宽 min_distance 到 1.0 Å 试跑。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**No output is produced, or the count is far below expectation.** "
#~ "`min_distance` may be too strict, `max_attempts` too small, or the input "
#~ "cell too dense to contain a valid site. As a diagnostic, reduce "
#~ "`min_distance` to 1.0 Å and try again."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**插入原子和宿主重叠。** 检查 min_distance 是否 ≤ 0（被跳过）。如果 "
#~ "min_distance 合理但仍重叠，增大 `max_attempts`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**An inserted atom overlaps the host.** Check whether `min_distance` is "
#~ "nonpositive, which disables the test. If the distance is reasonable but "
#~ "placements still look problematic, increase `max_attempts` and inspect "
#~ "the accepted structures."

